# Host canonicalization. The site is served from the apex; if the www host is
# attached as a custom domain it must 301 to the apex so search engines index one
# host. Only the www host is matched, so the apex can never loop.
# Deploy rule: never add a catch-all (/* /index.html 200). Unknown paths must 404.
https://www.correctionspestreference.org/* https://correctionspestreference.org/:splat 301
